<title>USA: Resource Mortgage says approves stock split.</title>
<headline>Resource Mortgage says approves stock split.</headline>
<dateline>GLEN ALLEN, Va. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Resource Mortgage Capital Inc said on Thursday that its shareholders had approved a 2-for-1 split of the company's common stock.</p>
<p>The record date for the stock split will be May 5, and new certificates will be mailed to record shareholders on or around May 23, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Resource Mortgage is a mortgage and consumer finance company.</p>
